<id/doc/doc_moringa_pterygosperma/#concept> a <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E55_Type>, skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Moringa Pterygosperma"@en ;
    skos:broader <id/grp/grp_vegetable_oils/#concept> ;
    skos:definition "*Gaertn.*; *Fl. Br. Ind.*, ii., 45; *Talbot, List Trees, etc.*, 1902, 118-9; *Gamble, Man. Ind. Timbs.*, 1902, 224-5; *Duthie, Fl. Upper Gang. Plain*, 1903, 192-3; *Cooke, Fl. Pres. Bomb.*, 1903, i., 282; **MORINGÆ**. The Horse-radish Tree, *sajuna* (or *sajina*), *shájnah, sunjna, munigha, munga arak, saragvo, sekto, muna-gácha jháda, músing, murungai, dándalon bín*, etc. [Sir George Watt, The Commercial Products of India (1908), scan p. 796]"@en ;
    skos:inScheme <id/scheme/#resource> ;
    skos:notation "doc_moringa_pterygosperma" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Moringa Pterygosperma"@en ;
    skos:scopeNote "Document-attested minor 19th-century commodity absent as a standalone line in Layer-1 British/Canadian customs ledgers; typically subsumed under htc:0124 (Oil Unenumerated). Attested in: Sir George Watt, The Commercial Products of India (1908), scan p. 796."@en ;
    <ontology/attestationBasis/#resource> "document_attested" ;
    <ontology/dictionarySource/#resource> <https://archive.org/details/b31361584/page/n796> ;
    <ontology/ghostAcresDomain/#resource> "fats_oils_soap" ;
